质与颜色替换为图2的样式。\n\n替换细节（鞋子）\n\n只针对脚部区域的像素进行无缝合成，新鞋子的透视角度、大小比例、与地面的接触阴影必须与图1原鞋一致，仅材质/色彩/纹理来自图2。\n\n如果图2鞋子带有特殊高光或品牌标识，需自适应图1的光照环境进行调色匹配。\n\n质量要求\n\n替换边界无接缝、无锯齿、无模糊，分辨率不低于图1原图。\n\n最终输出应为完整四宫格，不得裁剪或拉伸。\n\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 3, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["98ec245aad963151364f26dc6542113d769e33cdab52227fb8d92645771d9506.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [399.2018127441406, 552.3334350585938], "pos": [561, 496.5032958984375], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [1], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "image_url", "label": "image_url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [408.1711730957031, 412.7477111816406], "pos": [1595.051025390625, 498.7254638671875], "widgets_values": ["", 1909367341, "randomize", "3:4", "2k", false, "Third-party"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 2, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 3, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type":